WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.367
Write and send an estimate.

00:00:03.067 --> 00:00:07.700
A new estimate. Start here, or from the customer with New estimate.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:11.633
Open one. Let's look inside an estimate.

00:00:12.133 --> 00:00:22.900
One section per scope. Paver patio, Lighting, Walls … The customer sees each section with its total; materials inside stay hidden unless you tick them.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:30.967
Taxable or tax exempt. One click switches the section between Taxable and Tax exempt; the tax follows.

00:00:31.433 --> 00:00:40.000
Measure on the aerial photo. Trace the patio, driveway, beds or wall line; the areas go onto the estimate in one click.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:46.133
Pavers and colours. The customer's picks, and the Selection sheet for them to sign.

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:52.167
What the customer gets. Open or print exactly what the customer receives.

00:00:52.667 --> 00:01:03.333
Send it. Top right: Email it (or Email the link again / Send the update once it has gone out) and Print / PDF. Follow-ups due then show on My day.

00:01:03.833 --> 00:01:09.433
That's it. You can play this tour in the app any time: press Help, and ask in your own words.
